<title>USA: Pittsburg USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Pittsburg USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $5 million of Pittsburg USD, Calif., general boligation bonds, Election of 1995, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.33 percent.</p>
</text>
